// ## 2. Boundary 1 — Install trust boundary

// Files: `install/install.sh` (the curl|bash front door).
// Verifications (re-derived from the 2026-09-11 focused-install.oot
// §2 analysis + this turn's read of the current source):

// | Condition                                    | Behavior                       | Verdict |
// |----------------------------------------------|--------------------------------|---------|
// | sha256sum/shasum missing                     | err + need_fail=1 (install.sh:257-258) | fail-closed |
// | vrc==0 && -x dest                            | install, "SHA-256 verified"    | PASS    |
// | sha missing or non-200                       | "missing SHA-256 sidecar; refuse unsigned install" | fail-closed |
// | expected != actual                           | "checksum mismatch", return 1  | fail-closed |
// | dl != 200, no binary, core key               | exit 1 — refuses partial install | fail-closed |
// | dl == 404                                    | "not yet shipped" skip         | acceptable |

