//     time dudect, Red 8 dim 7, benchmark) — present and re-runnable.
//   - Per the 2026-09-11 focused-oodar.oot (prior turn, this session),
//     the dudect probe was double-run with consistent timing.
//
// **NIST KAT files** (Known-Answer Tests, RFC §1.5 verification):
//   - std/sec/: hash_kat.oo, sha_kat.oo, crypto_kat.oo, simd_kat.oo —
//     PRESENT, anchor-tracked.
//   - oodar/sec/pqc/: NO explicit KAT files for ML-KEM-768 or
//     ML-DSA-65. The implementations are split per FIPS comment
//     seams (commit 3e44843, 2026-09-06) but no `_kat.oo` companion
