// ## 7. Findings by severity

// CRITICAL (0): none.
// MAJOR (0): none.
// MINOR (1):
//   m1. oodar/sec/pqc/{mlkem,mldsa}/ lack on-disk NIST KAT companion
//       files. Implementation is split per FIPS seams (commit 3e44843)
//       but no `_kat.c` (or similar) probes the implementation
//       against NIST KAT vectors. Existing dudect probe covers
//       timing, not correctness. Recommend: add
//       `oodar/qa/tests_challenger_pqc_kat.c` reading embedded NIST
//       KAT vectors and asserting bit-exact match. Defer to v4.2.0
//       if the user wants this in a separate commit.
// NOTE (2):
//   n1. install.sh trust root is HTTPS-only (same origin as binary).
//       catalog/ has `index.minisig` + `registry.pub` — a minisign
//       sidecar would harden this. NOTE per install focused audit.
//   n2. `app/xlang/xlang.c` and `app/xlang/ffi_sec.c` still use
//       `oo_child_filter_env` (global environ mutation). Migration
//       to localized env builder is a v4.2.0 follow-up per CHANGES.

